<section class="page-hero"><div class="eyebrow">GOOD TO KNOW</div><h1>Everything you need<br />for an easy arrival.</h1><p>We want you outside, settled in, and having a good time as quickly as possible.</p></section>
<section class="section info-grid"><article><span>01</span><h2>Hours &amp; arrival</h2><p>Check-in is 2 PM–8 PM. Check-out is by 11 AM. The office is open daily, 8 AM–8 PM; after-hours arrivals can call ahead for instructions.</p></article><article><span>02</span><h2>Campground rules</h2><p>Quiet hours are 10 PM–7 AM. Fires belong in rings only. Keep pets leashed and attended. Please respect wildlife and leave your site cleaner than you found it.</p></article><article><span>03</span><h2>Need a hand?</h2><p>Call <a href="tel:5550100188">(555) 010-0188</a> or email <a href="mailto:hello@lakesidecampground.example">hello@lakesidecampground.example</a>. For an emergency, call 911.</p></article></section>
